    "problem_statement": "Verify the sequential transcription of ucos_CNode_Delete_impl in QCP_examples/osverify/certiucos/code/ios_cap.v against the sequential behavior of ucos_CNode_DeletePre/Post in certiucos/proofs/capability/lib/CapSpec.v; original proof is certiucos/proofs/capability/ucosCNodeDeleteProof.v.",
