    "expected_behavior": "Return 9 without mutation on invalid slot (>=255), invalid priority (>=64), null CSpace, or unsupported cap_type. On category type 1 clear slot_type, cap_type, category_content, category_right and preserve the union pointer. On object type 2 clear slot_type, cap_type, object_right, object_t and preserve Dummy_int. Return 0 on success. Preserve table entries and all unrelated resources.",
